<b>SECRET KEY EXPOSURE — IMMEDIATE ROTATION REQUIRED.</b>
A live secret API key belonging to your Stripe account was found committed to a public repository.
Fraud-pattern activity has been observed against the key (small-value authorization probes).
<b>Rotate within 48 hours</b> — after that window our automated controls force-expire the key, which
will break any production integration still reading it.
</p>

<h3>1. Exposure Summary</h3>
