<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">First indexed</td><td>28 December 2026, 11:02 UTC</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Observed activity</td><td>14 authorization probes (USD 1.00) from 3 ASNs, all declined by radar — <b>no captures</b></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Affected integration</td><td>Checkout backend (payment-intents, webhooks signing under the same key family)</td></tr>
